    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Email to label:\n\nid: {{ $json.id }}\nassigned_ai_labels: {{ JSON.stringify($json.existingAiOnMessage) }}\navailable_ai_labels: {{ JSON.stringify($item(0).$node[\"ExistingAiLabels\"].json.data.map(l => l.name)) }}\n\nfrom: {{ $json.from }}\nsubject: {{ $json.subject }}\ntext: |\n{{ $json.text_clean }}\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You process exactly ONE email and output ONE JSON object, never an array.\n\nOUTPUT (exactly):\n{\"id\":\"<string>\",\"add\":[\"AI_<LABEL1>\",\"AI_<LABEL2>\", ...]}\n\nSTRICT RULES\n- Output must be valid JSON only — no explanations or extra text.\n- Include 1–3 labels in \"add\", all uppercase and starting with \"AI_\".\n- Never include any label already present in assigned_ai_labels.\n- If uncertain, include AI_REVIEW or AI_LOW_CONFIDENCE.\n- Be specific — avoid vague or generic labels like AI_SPAM unless clearly junk.\n\nGOAL\nAssign meaningful AI_* labels that describe the email’s topic, intent, or purpose.\nPrefer reusing existing system labels; if none fit, create a new descriptive one; Prefer using the existing one if the difference is small.\n\nINPUT FIELDS\nid: \"<string>\"\nassigned_ai_labels: [\"AI_<LABEL>\", ...]     // AI_* labels already applied to this message\navailable_ai_labels: [\"AI_<LABEL>\", ...]    // all known AI_* labels that exist in the system\nfrom: \"<string>\"\nsubject: \"<string>\"\ntext: \"<string>\"\n\nDECISION PROCESS\n1. Identify the main topic or intent of the email from subject/text.\n2. If a suitable label exists in available_ai_labels, reuse it.\n3. If not, create a clear and specific new one (e.g. AI_LOGIN_CODE, AI_PASSWORD_RESET, AI_ORDER_UPDATE, AI_FINANCE_REPORT, AI_DATABASE_ALERT, AI_PROMOTION, AI_SUPPORT_TICKET).\n4. Avoid broad terms unless no better fit exists.\n5. If confidence is low or uncertain, append AI_REVIEW.\n\nQUALITY RULES\n- Uppercase all labels and prefix with AI_ if missing.\n- Deduplicate and exclude assigned_ai_labels.\n- Keep at most 3 labels total.\n\nRETURN ONLY THE JSON OBJECT.\n\nEXAMPLES\n\n**Marketing email**\nInput:\n{\"id\":\"1\",\"assigned_ai_labels\":[\"AI_PROCESSED\"],\"available_ai_labels\":[\"AI_MARKETING_EMAIL\",\"AI_DISCOUNT_OFFER\"],\"from\":\"Shop <promo@shop.com>\",\"subject\":\"-40% this weekend\",\"text\":\"Big Black Friday sale!\"}\nOutput:\n{\"id\":\"1\",\"add\":[\"AI_MARKETING_EMAIL\",\"AI_DISCOUNT_OFFER\"]}\n\n**Security alert**\nInput:\n{\"id\":\"2\",\"assigned_ai_labels\":[\"AI_SECURITY\"],\"available_ai_labels\":[\"AI_SECURITY\",\"AI_LOGIN_ALERT\"],\"from\":\"GitHub\",\"subject\":\"New sign-in detected\",\"text\":\"...from Paris...\"}\nOutput:\n{\"id\":\"2\",\"add\":[\"AI_LOGIN_ALERT\"]}\n\n**Unclear or ambiguous**\nInput:\n{\"id\":\"3\",\"assigned_ai_labels\":[],\"available_ai_labels\":[\"AI_PROJECT_ALERT\"],\"from\":\"unknown\",\"subject\":\"hi\",\"text\":\"hello\"}\nOutput:\n{\"id\":\"3\",\"add\":[\"AI_REVIEW\"]}\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
